n- Reproducible in 8aa37cab8950351d96f541581abdc42136283f24 (MSVC x86_64, latest)  \n\n\n\n\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta.mono (8aa37cab8) - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 4 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated AMD Radeon RX 7900 XTX (Advanced Micro Devices, Inc.; 32.0.21025.1024) - AMD Ryzen 9 3900X 12-Core Processor (24 threads) - 63.92 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\n\nJolt Physics may crash the engine upon/after collision checks of a shapecast  \nIn my \"reproductive sample\", it can take anywhere from seconds to minutes to occur, so it leads me to believe it's some kind of race-condition.\nThe issue only occurs when running physics in a separate thread.\n\n#### Additional notes / files \n\nI'm sorry for the brief description\nI'm still investigating the Issue myself, but am unsure if anything more comes up from my side.\n\nIn any case, I've included a crashdump, and a reproducible sample.  \nThe files are too big for GitHub, so they may only exist temporarily (please ping me when I can take them down)\n\n[Crashdump](https://sharex.1-3-3-7.dev/godot_dump/crash.dmp) (Godot @ 8aa37cab8950351d96f541581abdc42136283f24 built with mono module and debug symbols)   \n\n\n### Steps to reproduce / Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n**Edit**: smaller MRP from @mihe \n[Reproductive Sample](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21756765/physics-race-condition.zip  )  \n\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.githu